Metadata-Version: 2.4
Name: cb-trader
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: Coinbase Advanced Trade SDK-based trading scaffold
Requires-Python: >=3.10
Description-Content-Type: text/markdown
Requires-Dist: coinbase-advanced-py==1.8.2
Requires-Dist: python-dotenv==1.1.1
Requires-Dist: pydantic==2.9.2

## cb-trader scaffold

Activate venv:

```bash
source .venv/bin/activate
```

Install:

```bash
pip install -e .
```

Env file:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
# fill COINBASE_API_KEY and COINBASE_API_SECRET for private endpoints
```

CLI usage:

```bash
cb public --limit 5
cb accounts --limit 20
cb run --product BTC-USD --short 5 --long 20 --interval 2 --ticks 20
```
